# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/ni-framing.md#dispatcher-frames
# provenance: PV-0001, PV-0002, PV-0003, PV-0006, PV-0203
# kind: ni-stream
# description: A **DPTMMSG** dispatcher frame is an ordinary NI frame of length 14: the 12-byte literal plus 2 further bytes.
# derivation: u32 BE length 14 (PV-0001..PV-0003, PV-0203), then the literal of PV-0006 and 2 bytes whose content is unknown (gap #3), here arbitrary.
# expect.frames: 1
# expect.frame.1.offset: 4
# expect.frame.1.length: 14
# expect.error: none
# expect.trailing: 0
hex:
00 00 00 0E                                       # length 14, u32 BE
2A 2A 44 50 54 4D 4D 53 47 2A 2A 00               # * * D P T M M S G * * \0
A1 A2                                             # 2 trailing bytes (content unknown, #3; arbitrary)
